      ],
      "assessment": "CURATED_INTERPRETATION covers the seven immediate ingredient names in the nominal Difco Columbia Blood Agar Base formula published in the BD Difco & BBL Manual, second edition (2009), printed page 158 / PDF page 170. COMPLETE applies only to that nominal constituent-name list: all seven listed immediate ingredients are represented. This is not a complete molecular composition, an exact historical JCM1270 lot formulation, or a quantitative recipe transcription. The manufacturer performance-adjustment/supplementation footnote and unknown actual JCM lot remain explicit limitations. Component quantities and dry-mass ratios are not asserted. Blood and reconstitution water are not dry-base components. Existing mixed-owner partition and owner/role/export holds remain."
    },
